# Pinned by Origin (o=), not suite/codename (n=): our repo's reprepro
# config (.github/workflows/build-packages.yml) publishes Codename:
# trixie, which is the same string Debian's own main archive reports as
# its Codename - an n=trixie pin here would match ordinary Debian trixie
# packages too, not just ours. Origin: fbtech-nos is unique to our repo.
# See docs/TRIXIE-BASE.md.
Package: *
Pin: release o=fbtech-nos
Pin-Priority: 999
